This bonus attack can be used only once per combat. If you are firing a brace of duelling pistols, your model can fight with 2 Attacks in the first turn of close combat.
These attacks are resolved with a model’s Weapon Skill like any normal close combat attack and likewise may be parried.
Successful hits are resolved at Strength 4 and with a -2 save modifier, regardless of the firer’s Strength.

Double-barrelled: A double-barrelled weapon is a tricky piece of engineering, but it’s a wonderful piece
